{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwcBdjTgiqGWCKRjzkw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll ask you about it before I do anything. I'm not sure.\n\nThe page says to open the account at **פסגות** and buy the fund **\"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\"**. It says I'd be left with **86,045 ₪** after ten years. That's from putting in **70,000 ₪**: 10,000 at the start and 500 a month. Those weren't my numbers, they were already filled in. The 7% a year was already there too, and it's \"לדוגמה של האתר\", only the site's example, so it's a guess and not a promise. What put me off was a minus sign, \"‎-0.04%\", right under the fund it picked. And I've never heard of פסגות or אי.בי.אי. The big banks I know are lower down. Leumi shows 82,968 ₪ and Discount 79,491 ₪. The page says that's because their charges are higher.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **The top.** \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" (where it's cheapest to invest in the מדד), then a row of buttons with English letters. \"ת\"א-125\" was already chosen. It started with funds and English letters, so I almost left there.\n2. **Two boxes:** \"סכום היום\" 10,000 and \"הפקדה חודשית\" 500. Each has a slider under it, and I didn't touch the sliders. Then \"תשואה בשנה\" 7% and a button that says \"אינפלציה\".\n3. **A box with the results.** \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\", then \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\" with 86,045 ₪. Next to it was \"הזוג הבא בתור\" with 85,015 ₪ and \"‎-1,030 ₪\" in it.\n4. **A coloured bar of costs.** It shows 7,323 ₪ in total, and 5,555 of that is tax. I couldn't tell the colours apart.\n5. **A long list of banks and firms.** It went from פסגות at number 1 down to מיטב טרייד at 63,151 ₪. Each line says \"לא בחישוב\" (not in the calculation) about cheaper prices for soldiers, students and so on.\n6. **The fund's own box.** It shows \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\", \"נאמן 0.025%\" and \"קרן מחקה\". After that I was tired and stopped. I didn't go past the first two funds in \"כל הקרנות על מדד ת\"א-125\".\n\n**Words I didn't understand:**\n- \"S&P 500\", \"MSCI\"\n- מדד in the sense this page uses it\n- \"קרן מחקה\", \"נאמן\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"מחזיקה את המניות\", \"קרן סל\"\n- \"(4A)\", and the number 5112628 with an arrow next to it\n- \"העמלות זו על זו\"\n- \"בכסף של היום\": does that mean the number is cut down for inflation?\n\nThe dotted purple lines under the numbers: I don't know what they mean.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole page is black with grey writing. The small grey lines were hard to read even enlarged.\n- The minus signs, ‎-0.04% and ‎-1,030 ₪, scared me.\n- Too many numbers on one screen.\n- My own bank isn't the one it recommends.\n- Nothing here tells me whether this is as safe as my deposits. I didn't see the word פיקדון anywhere."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1928,"cache_read_input_tokens":15350,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1928},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"374334b5-e009-4ef3-978f-298d2fe42f6d","uuid":"967966e2-a191-4c06-92d4-f55656293f25","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:11:45.830Z","request_id":"req_011CgkwcBQMK5Ahu1aLSqbKr"}
